  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution 2023 to the Bilateral Emergency Fund with IFRC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Rifinanziamento Fondo Bilaterale Emergenza presso FICROSS /IFRC 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Bilateral Emergency Fund with IFRC for the year 2023, to support emergency appeals and response funds launched by IFRC in response to climate related hazards. IFRC protect women and girls from GBV.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="IT">Rifinanziamento Fondo Bilaterale Emergenza presso FICROSS per l&apos;anno 2023 per rispondere agli appelli e fondi di prima risposta lanciati da FICROSS per eventi calamitosi. FICROSS interviene per la protezione di donne, ragazze e bambine e protezione dalla GBV.</narrative>
  </description>
